From: phelps@ecstasy.CS.Berkeley.EDU (Tom Phelps)
Subject: ANNOUNCE: TkMan 1.8, a hypertext manual page browser
Date: 1996/11/13
Message-ID: <56dlki$rl@agate.berkeley.edu>
